  "claim": "Tuppence Middleton is the actress that plays both Iris Carr in The Lady Vanishes, and Riley Blue in Sense8.",
  "evidencia": "Page: The Lady Vanishes (2013 film). Sentence: The Lady Vanishes is a 2013 British television mystery thriller film directed by Diarmuid Lawrence, and a co-production of the BBC and Masterpiece Films.\nPage: The Lady Vanishes (2013 film). Sentence: It stars Selina Cadell in the key role of the disappearing Miss Froy, Tuppence Middleton as the young Iris Carr (who discovers the disappearance, but is not taken seriously), and Tom Hughes and Alex Jennings as Max Hare and the Professor, the two fellow English passengers who come to her aid.\nPage: Tuppence Middleton. Sentence: Tuppence Middleton (born 21 February 1987) is an English actress.\nPage: Tuppence Middleton. Sentence: Since 2015, she portrays Riley Blue in the Netflix webseries \"Sense8\".",
