        "original_id": "0d1788fd-4fd6-5cbb-849d-3d56d918e894",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tuppence Middleton, Selina Cadell, Tom Hughes, Alex Jennings, Diarmuid Lawrence\n- Works: The Lady Vanishes (2013 film), Sense8\n- Organizations: BBC, Masterpiece Films, Netflix\n- Roles: Iris Carr, Miss Froy, Max Hare, the Professor, Riley Blue\n- Topics: British television mystery thriller films, English actresses\n\nFacts:\n- Tuppence Middleton was born on 21 February 1987 and is an English actress.\n- The Lady Vanishes is a 2013 British television mystery thriller film directed by Diarmuid Lawrence.\n- The Lady Vanishes was co-produced by the BBC and Masterpiece Films.\n- In The Lady Vanishes, Selina Cadell plays Miss Froy, the disappearing woman.\n- In The Lady Vanishes, Tuppence Middleton plays Iris Carr, the young woman who discovers Miss Froy's disappearance but is not taken seriously.\n- In The Lady Vanishes, Tom Hughes and Alex Jennings play Max Hare and the Professor, two English passengers who help Iris Carr.\n- Since 2015, Tuppence Middleton has portrayed Riley Blue in the Netflix webseries Sense8.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
